% Fixture for testing state_mutation and invariant obligation patterns.

<contract_rules>
R1 - Set field on success
When consume is called with requested_tokens less than or equal to tokens_available, the service MUST set tokens_available to tokens_available minus requested_tokens.

R2 - Increase on refill
When refill is called with a positive amount, the service MUST increase tokens_available by amount.

R3 - Cap on overflow
When refill would exceed capacity, the service MUST keep tokens_available less than or equal to capacity.

R4 - No mutation on failure
When consume fails, the service MUST NOT mutate tokens_available.

R5 - Maintain invariant
When any operation completes, the service MUST maintain tokens_available greater than or equal to zero.
</contract_rules>
